   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "① Client submits domains  ② API normalizes + de-duplicates, stores the job and enqueues one task per domain, returns 202 immediately\n③ Any free worker thread takes a task (each task goes to exactly one worker)  ④ DNS lookups (in parallel) then HTTP probe, 20 s deadline\n⑤ Result saved per domain as soon as it is done  ⑥ GET (any API instance) shows live progress: PENDING → IN_PROGRESS → COMPLETED / COMPLETED_WITH_ERRORS",
   "originalText": "① Client submits domains  ② API normalizes + de-duplicates, stores the job and enqueues one task per domain, returns 202 immediately\n③ Any free worker thread takes a task (each task goes to exactly one worker)  ④ DNS lookups (in parallel) then HTTP probe, 20 s deadline\n⑤ Result saved per domain as soon as it is done  ⑥ GET (any API instance) shows live progress: PENDING → IN_PROGRESS → COMPLETED / COMPLETED_WITH_ERRORS",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
